{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lambert, Devan, and Jaskya are Ley Sensitives, gifted people with supernatural abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what is the story behind these powers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join 8 different characters on a journey where they learn more about themselves, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">their talents, and how they are part of a larger plan that will decide the fate of the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">world of Orphania and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leyline Chronicles is a classic JRPG and a tribute to the retro RPGs of the 90s and offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b] A vast world filled with diverse regions, monsters, bustling cities, and small side stories that all weave into the epic main storyline.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/Map_GIF.gif?t=1752502757\" /></div></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b] Over eight unique characters, each with side stories that reveal and explore their backgrounds and motivations.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/BG-chars.png?t=1752502757\" /></div></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b] A turn-based combo combat system with voice acting that rewards strategic, forward-thinking gameplay.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/Battle_GIF.gif?t=1752502757\" /></div></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b] Trouble Quad! A thrilling card mini-game inspired by Triple Triad. Collect powerful cards and battle your way through the secret tournament against the world\u2019s top challengers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/Card_GIF.gif?t=1752502757\" /></div></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b] A streamlined crafting system that lets you upgrade weapons and armor, unlocking new skills and combos for your party.</p></strong></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fiery devotion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/bee3ea1ed3f30a355178686b61e7b516e3ffd73c.jpg"},{"name":"Protection of faith.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/33f147c96205847c38c61c79a48100b0320ff04d.jpg"},{"name":"Power of devotion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/edf47a088f2c5e117669694c51de8ed546cedb35.jpg"},{"name":"Solidarity.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/ebf69fe2e5ae292725372d8cd94fdeab500339c9.jpg"},{"name":"Old secrets revelead.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/540fa2801e335b9b15cc0e9527ea4445c3d36b67.jpg"},{"name":"End of eternity.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/843950d26dae2ad613c6bf62e0195d1edc9c43d2.jpg"},{"name":"Completion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/43998f1489c57a26c9fa8b1d8b44a42381ffc99c.jpg"},{"name":"Family pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/d83f591989a2815ba9c5122ceb1765445d39db31.jpg"},{"name":"Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3147140/bc84570470316703f2d197fac410cec161f0c834.jpg"},{"name":"Redemption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap